  plus sheet x=437 word [5, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2]: differing chord [(0, 17)] (sum 27 = t_17); actual pattern word-realisable: True
  plus sheet x=581 word [4, 3, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1]: differing chord [(0, 17)] (sum 27 = t_17); actual pattern word-realisable: False
